  "narrative": {
    "text": "One of three miniature learning-curve plots embedded inside Figure 4.1, the chapter's framework schematic (\"In phase 1 (left), the learning...\"). It shows five coloured curves rising from 0 and flattening by roughly x=20 on an unlabelled 0-50 horizontal axis against a 0.0-1.0 vertical one: an orange curve settling near 0.97, red and green both near 0.62 (green rising more slowly and crossing red at about x=27), blue near 0.46 and purple near 0.33. No axis titles, legend or tick labels beyond the numbers — it is an illustration of the SHAPE of a learning curve inside the diagram, not a figure to be read for values.",
